{"unit_id": "tag:01O9:proof", "translation": "利用刻画（characterization）（3）构造态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>，在<MATH_0003>上局部进行。利用引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>中的唯一性（uniqueness），证明该构造（construction）能够粘合（glues）。细节略。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "characterization", "target_term": "刻画"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "uniqueness", "target_term": "唯一性"}, {"source_term": "construction", "target_term": "构造"}, {"source_term": "glues", "target_term": "粘合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "characterization", "target_term": "刻画", "context": "指命题中用于确定所构造对象的第（3）项刻画。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指命题所给出的概形之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指被引用的唯一性结论所属的引理。"}, {"source_term": "uniqueness", "target_term": "唯一性", "context": "指被引用引理中用来推出局部构造可粘合的唯一性。"}, {"source_term": "construction", "target_term": "构造", "context": "回指前一句中局部得到所需对象的构造。"}, {"source_term": "glues", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "指局部构造彼此相容而能够粘合。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02NB:title", "translation": "用可逆（invertible）层（sheaves）作扭转（Twisting）与相对射影谱（relative Proj）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "Twisting", "target_term": "扭转"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰用于扭转的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指用于扭转的可逆层，英文保留复数词形。"}, {"source_term": "Twisting", "target_term": "扭转", "context": "指用可逆层改变分次代数的构造。"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱", "context": "指从概形上的分次代数构造相对齐次谱的操作。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02NB:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为一个准凝聚（quasi-coherent）分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra）。设<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>上的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）。在这种情形下，我们得到另一个准凝聚（quasi-coherent）分次（graded）<MATH_0006>-代数（algebra），即\n<MATH_0007>\n结果表明，<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>具有同构（isomorphic）的相对齐次谱（relative homogeneous spectra）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "relative homogeneous spectra", "target_term": "相对齐次谱"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指分次代数和可逆层所在的底概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "修饰作为输入的分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "描述作为输入的代数的分次结构。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指原先给定的分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "描述给定层的可逆性。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指给定概形上的可逆层，英文保留单数词形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "准凝聚", "context": "修饰构造所得的分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "描述构造所得代数的分次结构。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指构造所得的另一个分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "描述两个相对齐次谱之间的关系。"}, {"source_term": "relative homogeneous spectra", "target_term": "相对齐次谱", "context": "指由这两个分次代数分别得到的相对齐次谱，英文保留复数词形。"}], "notes": []}
